设施，如使用周转容器生产，应配备周转容器的清洗消毒设施。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5.2.3.2 与产品接触的设备及管道的清洗消毒应配备清洗系统，鼓励使用原位清洗系统(CIP)，并定期对清洗系统的清洗效果进行评估。"}]}},"version":2,"versionNonce":409237058,"index":"b0I","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"locked":false},{"id":"nstv9vns941cyi8bbzn1i","type":"text","x":1343.8,"y":7092.5,"width":338.80000000000007,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1B5E20","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"[paragraph]","text":"[paragraph]","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"91t15bbnypyhnmtozmcq","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":1727432414,"index":"b0J","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"ehha7v4kbbjpeddqep22vg","type":"arrow","x":1053.6,"y":7110,"width":159.60000000000014,"height":0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[159.60000000000014,0]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"clwxtbm0htchrel8fkt6h","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"91t15bbnypyhnmtozmcq","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":247488002,"index":"b0K","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"b076miptphdb4im916lj5n","type":"rectangle","x":478.4,"y":7942.5,"width":575.2,"height":95,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"#E8EAF6","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.7,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"3ae5yfaqo1s4wo7xkl1rd"},{"type":"arrow","id":"uzgf7oq4kypevxznvkq9a"},{"type":"arrow","id":"8a6ju5nrn8479l9i8dvqb"},{"type":"arrow","id":"24jqxsfebxm7iwmmcxuiwc"},{"type":"text","id":"717wdm2z6hrcjmidqs60wn"}],"version":2,"versionNonce":41810718,"index":"b0L","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"717wdm2z6hrcjmidqs60wn","type":"text","x":528.4,"y":7967.5,"width":475.20000000000005,"height":45,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1A237E","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"5.2.4 个人卫生设施","text":"5.2.4 个人卫生设施","fontSize":36,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"b076miptphdb4im916lj5n","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":1758023106,"index":"b0M","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"3ae5yfaqo1s4wo7xkl1rd","type":"arrow","x":358.4,"y":10150,"width":120,"height":2160,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.8,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[60,0],[60,-2160],[120,-2160]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"cb3o9c41u2e1yx1lic1cfo","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"b076miptphdb4im916lj5n","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":1569515358,"index":"b0N","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"m2z1keqfsycwjcf99twd9n","type":"embeddable","x":1213.2,"y":7350,"width":600,"height":400,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"#E8F5E9","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"uzgf7oq4kypevxznvkq9a"},{"type":"text","id":"g79qsgnba7j7ncy0ztx3r6"}],"link":"demo.md","customData":{"jsonValue":{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5.2.4.1 生产场所或生产车间入口处应设置更衣室，洗手、干手和消毒设施，换鞋(穿戴鞋套)设施或工作鞋靴消毒设施，必要时应设置风淋设施。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5.2.4.2 出入清洁作业区的人员应有防止交叉污染的措施，如要求更换工作服、工作鞋靴或鞋套。若采用吹瓶、灌装、封盖(封口)一体设备的灌装防护区入口可依据实际需求调整。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5.2.4.3 液体饮料清洁作业区内的灌装防护区如对空气洁净度有更高要求时，入口应设置二次更衣室，洗手和(或)消毒设施，换鞋(穿戴鞋套)设施或工作鞋靴消毒设施，必要时应设置风淋设施。符合下列条件之一的可不设置上述设施："}]}},"version":2,"versionNonce":1000228226,"index":"b0O","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"locked":false},{"id":"g79qsgnba7j7ncy0ztx3r6","type":"text","x":1343.8,"y":7532.5,"width":338.80000000000007,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1B5E20","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"[paragraph]","text":"[paragraph]","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"m2z1keqfsycwjcf99twd9n","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":141839262,"index":"b0P","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"uzgf7oq4kypevxznvkq9a","type":"arrow","x":1053.6,"y":7990,"width":159.60000000000014,"height":440,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[79.80000000000018,0],[79.80000000000018,-440],[159.60000000000014,-440]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"b076miptphdb4im916lj5n","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"m2z1keqfsycwjcf99twd9n","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":545146178,"index":"b0Q","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"n6gei94dabdb21pnhvnxu","type":"embeddable","x":1213.2,"y":7790,"width":600,"height":400,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"#E8F5E9","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"8a6ju5nrn8479l9i8dvqb"},{"type":"text","id":"h2g1nl6kwn7mqaj85kfcz"}],"link":"demo.md","customData":{"jsonValue":{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"a）使用自带洁净室及洁净环境自动恢复功能的灌装设备；"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"b）使用灌装和封盖(封口)都在无菌密闭环境下进行的灌装设备；"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"c）非直接饮用产品[如食品工业用浓缩液(汁、浆)、食品工业用饮料浓浆等]的灌装防护区入口。"}]}},"version":2,"versionNonce":1634019294,"index":"b0R","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"locked":false},{"id":"h2g1nl6kwn7mqaj85kfcz","type":"text","x":1343.8,"y":7972.5,"width":338.80000000000007,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1B5E20","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"[paragraph]","text":"[paragraph]","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"n6gei94dabdb21pnhvnxu","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":818433282,"index":"b0S","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"8a6ju5nrn8479l9i8dvqb","type":"arrow","x":1053.6,"y":7990,"width":159.60000000000014,"height":0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[159.60000000000014,0]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"b076miptphdb4im916lj5n","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"n6gei94dabdb21pnhvnxu","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":1483766814,"index":"b0T","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"75fbxlhu1ru6pgnl7ss4uo","type":"embeddable","x":1213.2,"y":8230,"width":600,"height":400,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"#E8F5E9","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"24jqxsfebxm7iwmmcxuiwc"},{"type":"text","id":"5z1usfsa3hu4ffs9yigyn3"}],"link":"demo.md","customData":{"jsonValue":{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5.2.4.4 固体饮料的配料区、干燥脱水区/混合区、内包装区入口处应设置洗手和(或)消毒设施，换鞋（穿戴鞋套）设施或工作鞋靴消毒设施。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5.2.4.5 如设置风淋设施，应定期对其进行清洁和维护。"}]}},"version":2,"versionNonce":33250498,"index":"b0U","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"locked":false},{"id":"5z1usfsa3hu4ffs9yigyn3","type":"text","x":1343.8,"y":8412.5,"width":338.80000000000007,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1B5E20","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"[paragraph]","text":"[paragraph]","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"75fbxlhu1ru6pgnl7ss4uo","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":864503902,"index":"b0V","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"24jqxsfebxm7iwmmcxuiwc","type":"arrow","x":1053.6,"y":7990,"width":159.60000000000014,"height":440,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[79.80000000000018,0],[79.80000000000018,440],[159.60000000000014,440]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"b076miptphdb4im916lj5n","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"75fbxlhu1ru6pgnl7ss4uo","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":565605506,"index":"b0W","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"wfj5sbu9rdgq0nilm02nk","type":"rectangle","x":478.4,"y":8822.5,"width":496,"height":95,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"#E8EAF6","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.7,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"9kg78shz0097v8pkt81hpv"},{"type":"arrow","id":"eqevyxb8rsspbmsn8pkp9g"},{"type":"text","id":"78660z900niphixd0h60b"}],"version":2,"versionNonce":1383763102,"index":"b0X","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"78660z900niphixd0h60b","type":"text","x":528.4,"y":8847.5,"width":396,"height":45,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1A237E","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"5.2.5 仓储设施","text":"5.2.5 仓储设施","fontSize":36,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"wfj5sbu9rdgq0nilm02nk","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":297309250,"index":"b0Y","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"9kg78shz0097v8pkt81hpv","type":"arrow","x":358.4,"y":10150,"width":120,"height":1280,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.8,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[60,0],[60,-1280],[120,-1280]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"cb3o9c41u2e1yx1lic1cfo","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"wfj5sbu9rdgq0nilm02nk","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":1929070814,"index":"b0Z","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"01tzdatzkrlj110qco4i7v5","type":"embeddable","x":1213.2,"y":8670,"width":600,"height":400,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"#E8F5E9","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"eqevyxb8rsspbmsn8pkp9g"},{"type":"text","id":"wcldw97zhnnozopcyqk2y"}],"link":"demo.md","customData":{"jsonValue":{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5.2.5.1 应具有与所生产产品的数量、贮存要求、周转容器周转期及产品检验周期相适应的仓储设施，仓储设施包括自有仓库或外租仓库。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5.2.5.2 同一仓库贮存性质不同的物品时，应适当分离或分隔（如分类、分架、分区存放等），并有明显的标识。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5.2.5.3 必要时应具有冷藏(冻)库，冷藏(冻)库应配备可正确显示库内温、湿度的设施。"}]}},"version":2,"versionNonce":1138801666,"index":"b0a","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"locked":false},{"id":"wcldw97zhnnozopcyqk2y","type":"text","x":1343.8,"y":8852.5,"width":338.80000000000007,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1B5E20","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":