设备","text":"5.3.1 生产设备","fontSize":36,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"6h7ktvmhrcqhcrplon81lt","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":200862174,"index":"b0h","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"zs1riv8zyugtvnc3nm3g","type":"arrow","x":358.4,"y":10150,"width":120,"height":735,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.8,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[60,0],[60,-735],[120,-735]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"cb3o9c41u2e1yx1lic1cfo","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"6h7ktvmhrcqhcrplon81lt","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":2076814082,"index":"b0i","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"5zw8b33lhiwhzky7zqj1b","type":"embeddable","x":1213.2,"y":9215,"width":600,"height":400,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"#E8F5E9","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"fno14ql5q6z7zu4vwgra"},{"type":"text","id":"mzgreztitjpt7ax11lyyem"}],"link":"demo.md","customData":{"jsonValue":{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"应配备与生产能力和实际工艺相适应的设备，液体饮料生产一般包括：水处理设备、配料设施、过滤设备（需过滤的产品）、杀菌设备（需杀菌的产品）、自动灌装封盖（封口）设备、生产日期标注设备、工器具的清洗消毒设施等，固体饮料生产一般包括：混合配料设备、焙烤设备（有焙烤工艺的）、干燥脱水设备（有湿法生产工艺的）、包装设备、生产日期标注设备等。"}]}},"version":2,"versionNonce":1060896286,"index":"b0j","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"locked":false},{"id":"mzgreztitjpt7ax11lyyem","type":"text","x":1343.8,"y":9397.5,"width":338.80000000000007,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1B5E20","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"[paragraph]","text":"[paragraph]","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"5zw8b33lhiwhzky7zqj1b","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":1629551298,"index":"b0k","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"fno14ql5q6z7zu4vwgra","type":"arrow","x":974.4,"y":9415,"width":238.80000000000007,"height":0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[238.80000000000007,0]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"6h7ktvmhrcqhcrplon81lt","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"5zw8b33lhiwhzky7zqj1b","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":2039646814,"index":"b0l","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"rqvecc38gypladkxrotnf","type":"rectangle","x":478.4,"y":9807.5,"width":496,"height":95,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"#E8EAF6","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.7,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"hdyb6gicskseyv5rnecxl"},{"type":"arrow","id":"2shrcov7xbpsejw0h1rct"},{"type":"text","id":"3tvbm1yr36hei9e5t4x46"}],"version":2,"versionNonce":108548738,"index":"b0m","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"3tvbm1yr36hei9e5t4x46","type":"text","x":528.4,"y":9832.5,"width":396,"height":45,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1A237E","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"5.3.2 设备要求","text":"5.3.2 设备要求","fontSize":36,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"rqvecc38gypladkxrotnf","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":2043514526,"index":"b0n","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"hdyb6gicskseyv5rnecxl","type":"arrow","x":358.4,"y":10150,"width":120,"height":295,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.8,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[60,0],[60,-295],[120,-295]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"cb3o9c41u2e1yx1lic1cfo","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"rqvecc38gypladkxrotnf","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":2123280962,"index":"b0o","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"nmljot6n3uar134e1rvtnj","type":"embeddable","x":1213.2,"y":9655,"width":600,"height":400,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"#E8F5E9","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"2shrcov7xbpsejw0h1rct"},{"type":"text","id":"pd1gsfj0v3fndd87qp1d2g"}],"link":"demo.md","customData":{"jsonValue":{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5.3.2.1 灌装、封盖(封口)设备鼓励采用全自动设备，避免交叉污染和人员直接接触待包装食品。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5.3.2.2 生产设备应有明显的运行状态标识，并定期维护、保养和验证。设备安装、维修、保养的操作不应影响产品的质量。设备应进行验证或确认，确保各项性能满足工艺要求。无法正常使用的设备应有明显标识。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5.3.2.3 每次生产前应检查设备是否处于正常状态，防止影响产品安全的情形发生；出现故障应及时排除并记录故障发生时间、原因及可能受影响的产品批次。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5.3.2.4 设备备件应贮存在专门的区域，以便设备维修时能及时获得，并应保持备件贮存区域清洁干燥。"}]}},"version":2,"versionNonce":2090732254,"index":"b0p","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"locked":false},{"id":"pd1gsfj0v3fndd87qp1d2g","type":"text","x":1343.8,"y":9837.5,"width":338.80000000000007,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1B5E20","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"[paragraph]","text":"[paragraph]","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"nmljot6n3uar134e1rvtnj","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":742595074,"index":"b0q","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"2shrcov7xbpsejw0h1rct","type":"arrow","x":974.4,"y":9855,"width":238.80000000000007,"height":0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[238.80000000000007,0]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"rqvecc38gypladkxrotnf","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"nmljot6n3uar134e1rvtnj","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":9764638,"index":"b0r","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"yttvlecn2z9pqbialnxn","type":"rectangle","x":478.4,"y":10247.5,"width":337.6,"height":95,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"#E8EAF6","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.7,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"l5dsxyi9ry9v0ty0zao19"},{"type":"arrow","id":"0wuz8nzjyk1x9jzldgr1x"},{"type":"text","id":"p3uekpshpar6e8yxkvr7km"}],"version":2,"versionNonce":1049921986,"index":"b0s","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"p3uekpshpar6e8yxkvr7km","type":"text","x":528.4,"y":10272.5,"width":237.60000000000002,"height":45,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1A237E","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"6 卫生管理","text":"6 卫生管理","fontSize":36,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"yttvlecn2z9pqbialnxn","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":170093406,"index":"b0t","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"l5dsxyi9ry9v0ty0zao19","type":"arrow","x":358.4,"y":10150,"width":120,"height":145,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.8,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[60,0],[60,145],[120,145]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"cb3o9c41u2e1yx1lic1cfo","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"yttvlecn2z9pqbialnxn","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":748814722,"index":"b0u","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"zbeqot8wx6g4un4lrbejwi","type":"embeddable","x":1213.2,"y":10095,"width":600,"height":400,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"#E8F5E9","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"0wuz8nzjyk1x9jzldgr1x"},{"type":"text","id":"klctipxcdi9m610c3d0f2g"}],"link":"demo.md","customData":{"jsonValue":{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"6.1 应符合GB14881—2013中第6章的相关规定。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"6.2 清洁作业区的空调机和净化空气口应定期维护。"}]}},"version":2,"versionNonce":1738166174,"index":"b0v","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"locked":false},{"id":"klctipxcdi9m610c3d0f2g","type":"text","x":1343.8,"y":10277.5,"width":338.80000000000007,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1B5E20","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"[paragraph]","text":"[paragraph]","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"zbeqot8wx6g4un4lrbejwi","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":833257794,"index":"b0w","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"0wuz8nzjyk1x9jzldgr1x","type":"arrow","x":816,"y":10295,"width":397.20000000000005,"height":0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[397.20000000000005,0]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"yttvlecn2z9pqbialnxn","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"zbeqot8wx6g4un4lrbejwi","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":1965730782,"index":"b0x","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"fgt7m1wrot44ol0y6aqa06","type":"rectangle","x":478.4,"y":10520,"width":575.2,"height":140,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"#E8EAF6","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.7,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"lu3j2f7z6lgdxjo0bkmup"},{"type":"text","id":"scnzfvctndbtz9ewgemui"}],"version":2,"versionNonce":1225591042,"index":"b0y","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"scnzfvctndbtz9ewgemui","type":"text","x":528.4,"y":10545,"width":475.20000000000005,"height":90,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1A237E","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"7 食品原料、食品添加剂和食品相关产品","text":"7 食品原料、食品添加剂\n和食品相关产品","fontSize":36,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"fgt7m1wrot44ol0y6aqa06","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":2,"version":2,"versionNonce":1625653278,"index":"b0z","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"lu3j2f7z6lgdxjo0bkmup","type":"arrow","x":358.4,"y":10150,"width":120,"height":440,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.8,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[60,0],[60,440],[120,440]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"cb3o9c41u2e1yx1lic1cfo","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"fgt7m1wrot44ol0y6aqa06","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":709400770,"index":"b10","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"0ji2hoanybc34p2ent6w4n","type":"rectangle","x":478.4,"y":10837.5,"width":416.8,"height":95,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"#E8EAF6","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.7,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"x78y6di8sjju1mi2p5p4i"},{"type":"arrow","id":"eb7d771n6isb6lmwaj4v7e"},{"type":"text","id":"rcfbqcazs6h2rdrfbv4088"}],"version":2,"versionNonce":1857801310,"index":"b11","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"rcfbqcazs6h2rdrfbv4088","type":"text","x":528.4,"y":10862.5,"width":316.8,"height":45,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1A237E","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"7.1 一般要求","text":"7.1 一般要求","fontSize":36,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"0ji2hoanybc34p2ent6w4n","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":1157378178,"index":"b12","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"x78y6di8sjju1mi2p5p4i","type":"arrow","x":358.4,"y":10150,"width":120,"height":735,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#283593","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.8,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"points":[[0,0],[60,0],[60,735],[120,735]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"cb3o9c41u2e1yx1lic1cfo","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[1,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"0ji2hoanybc34p2ent6w4n","focus":0.5,"gap":4,"fixedPoint":[0,0.5001]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"version":2,"versionNonce":1014927518,"index":"b13","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false,"lastCommittedPoint":null},{"id":"pc2ublq7r9eqwygm48ff","type":"embeddable","x":1213.2,"y":10685,"width":600,"height":400,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2E7D32","backgroundColor":"#E8F5E9","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"type":"arrow","id":"eb7d771n6isb6lmwaj4v7e"},{"type":"text","id":"rxffon0il7q6lwv9j5jnao"}],"link":"demo.md","customData":{"jsonValue":{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"7.1.1 应符合GB14881—2013中第7章的相关规定。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"7.1.2 企业应建立原料、食品添加剂和食品相关产品供应商管理制度，规定供应商的选择、审核、评估程序，并在与其签订的合同中明确双方应承担的安全责任。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"7.1.3 应对供应商采用的工艺流程和安全措施进行评估，必要时应进行定期现场评审或对流程进行监控。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"7.1.4启封后的原料未用尽时必须密封，存放于适当场所，防止污染，在确保产品质量的前提下，在保质期内尽快使用。固体原料在进入投料间时，应先除去外包装或采用有效措施防止交叉污染。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"7.1.5 应保存食品原料、食品添加剂和食品相关产品采购、验收、贮存和运输的相关记录，保存期限不得少于产品保质期满后6个月；没有明确保质期的，保存期限不得少于2年。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"7.1.6 需要清洗的原料，清洗原水应符合GB5749中的相关规定。再利用的清洗用水应符合工艺和卫生要求，避免交叉污染。"},{"type":"hardbreak"},{"type":"text","text":"7.1.7 具有吸附性的原料应避免与有强烈气味的原料或其他物品共同运输、贮存。"}]}},"version":2,"versionNonce":1021759554,"index":"b14","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"updated":1763977364290,"locked":false},{"id":"rxffon0il7q6lwv9j5jnao","type":"text","x":1343.8,"y":10867.5,"width":338.80000000000007,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1B5E20","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","opacity":100,"roundness":null,"originalText":"[paragraph]","text":"[paragraph]","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"pc2ublq7r9eqwygm48ff","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"lineCount":1,"version":2,"versionNonce":98487518,"index":"b15","isDeleted":false,"roughness":1,"seed":1,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1763977364290,"link":null,"locked":false},{"i